      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Trace 演示说明\n- 业务请求会通过 `OpenTelemetry` 写入 `Jaeger`\n- `Grafana` 只负责给出慢链路线索和指标趋势\n- 当流量被打到 `device-service -> resource-service / audit-service` 后，请切到 `https://jaeger.qytk8s.com` 查看瀑布图",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Trace Playbook",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service, target_service) (rate(qytang_outbound_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} -> {{target_service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Service Hop Traffic",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service, target_service) (rate(qytang_outbound_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} -> {{target_service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Hop Latency P95",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
